   |     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ required by this bound in `Vars::<T0>::render`
   = note: this error originates in the macro `typed_handlebars::str` (in Nightly builds, run with -Z macro-backtrace for more info)
